# 01-07 Story 4: streaming a tab to the REAL Office through the extension (2026-11-03), tests/extension_harness/office_driver.py, final run on the finished code
# tests/live.py muted both Office members first and restored them afterwards. Real service on :8737 (sonos service run), branded Chrome 156, the unmodified extension/, a 440 Hz tone page. Earlier runs on the same day: the first timed out ('The service didn't answer in time') because the service waited for the speaker before answering started; the second played but classed the stream as 'other source' because the speaker reports the track URI with the scheme twice. Both were fixed (see the epic).

